  # gh-944: the fetch must carry a DESTINATION refspec. A bare
  # `refs/heads/<branch>` refspec materializes NO tracking ref in an
  # actions/checkout single-branch clone (remote.origin.fetch is pinned to
  # the head branch), so the checkout below either fails to resolve the ref
